sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Producer
  participant Q as BufferQueue
  participant C as Consumer/SF
  P->>Q: connect
  P->>Q: dequeue slot
  P->>P: render into buffer
  P->>Q: queue + acquire fence
  C->>Q: acquire
  C->>C: fence wait
  C->>C: compose/present
  C->>Q: release + release fence
  Q-->>P: producer reuse
  P->>Q: disconnect
